category: Libs
build-depends: cygport gcc-fortran libjonquil-devel libtoml-f-devel
sdesc: "Modular computation tool chain library (utilities)"
ldesc: "This library supports reading and writing in more than ten different geometry
formats, including general ASCII formats, like xyz, JSON based formats, like
QCSchema, and program specific formats, for example compatible with Turbomole
or Vasp."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/grimme-lab/mctc-lib
